This product includes design and implementation insights informed by:

  anthropic-proxy (https://github.com/maxnowack/anthropic-proxy)
  Copyright (c) Max Nowack
  Licensed under the MIT License

  The streaming state machine in src/stream.ts follows the same overall
  approach (tool-call JSON accumulation, content-block lifecycle tracking,
  finish_reason → stop_reason mapping). No code was copied verbatim; the
  implementation here is independent and adapted to TypeScript with strict
  typing and an exposed library API.
